nd proposed use.\n\n2.  **Map Sources to Units (Mental Filtering & Selection):**\n    *Unit 1: Clinical evidence level (Phase II signal vs Phase III gap)*\n    - Needs: Reviews/papers discussing clinical trial phases, lack of Phase III, early phase signals, heterogeneity in intervention trials.\n    - Candidates: P0600 (explicitly states no completed Phase III), P0601 (small samples, Phase 1/II), P0602 (TACITO Phase 2a), P0583 (FMT-LUMINate Phase 2), P0212 (summary efficacy data, heterogeneity), P0215 (clinical status, I/II phase focus), P0648 (GRADE assessment, moderate-low certainty, needs large multicenter RCT).\n    - Selection: P0600, P0601, P0602, P0583, P0212, P0215, P0648. (Already suggested in catalog, but I need to format them properly according to instructions. The prompt says \"对照已有 cases/supporting_studies 的具体贡献，新论文需补充不同结果、条件、方法、发展阶段或有用对照；仅重复相同概括时留在备选池，additions可为空。\" Wait, the catalog already has `case_suggestions` for these units. I should pick from the provided `source_routing` that aren't fully covered or add complementary ones if needed, but the prompt says \"当前调用只负责一个 chapter_id... 返回 JSON 对象：additions 数组\". I will select from the provided list that best fits, ensuring they meet the criteria. I'll stick to the high-quality matches from the routing.)\n    - Let's check the routing list for Unit 1 relevant sources: P0600, P0601, P0602, P0583, P0212, P0215, P0648 are all in the routing/materials. I will formulate their `proposed_use` carefully.\n\n    *Unit 2: Detection tech heterogeneity (relative abundance vs absolute quantification)*\n    - Needs: Papers discussing sequencing methods, metabolite quantification, GC-MS/LC-MS, reference ranges, spatial/metabolomic integration, lack of SOPs.\n    - Candidates: P0589 (lack of closed chain, quantitative validation, Akkermansia non-monotonicity), P0609 (GC-MS protocol for 14 SCFAs, reference ranges from HMDB not cancer-specific), P0641 (absence of standardized metabolomic protocols, workflow/reporting), 